Your eyes penetrate the darkness to find anyone that may be hiding there. This allows you to see through creeping darkness out to a radius of 10. You can also find your way through the darkness with greater speed ([+75%, +125%, +170%, +211%, +250% (TL1-5)] movement into creeping darkness).

You do [+5%, +9%, +12%, +15%, +17% (TL1-5)] damage to anything that has entered your creeping dark.
